            0.138,
            0.903,
            0.178
          ],
          "content": "From the above, you can easily say that quadrilaterals ABCD and PQRS of Fig. 6.5 are similar."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.282,
